I found 36 instances of the symbol: a circle with crossed lines and a T-bar on top. I excluded the circles with only horizontal hatching, which are a different symbol. I excluded the squares with a circle inside, and I excluded the circle labelled 9 at about (547, 1322). That circle is a judgement call, because it looks hatched rather than crossed.

I checked most of the drawing with 7 zooms, but not every part of it. I took a few instances from the overview alone: the one at about (769, 1056), one at about (1186, 377), and the two at the top centre near (759, 274) and (789, 266). The count may be off by a few if I misjudged a crossed circle against a hatched one.

